library/
rulebook_cache/*
!rulebook_cache/srd_2014/
!rulebook_cache/srd_2024/

# Campaign data never goes in this repo. It's a public framework, so anything
# committed here is one push away from being published: characters, the secret
# arc, session notes. Each campaign folder is its own (private) git repo
# instead; see "Saving a Campaign" in CLAUDE.md. events/ is dm20's adventure
# log, shared across campaigns, and stays local.
# scripts/hooks/guard_campaign_privacy.py backs this up for pushes Claude runs.
campaigns/*
!campaigns/README.md
events/
